  <p><font style="margin:0 0 0 0;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:1pt;font-family:Times New Roman;">Business model Adtran is a global vendor with scale and diversity Portfolio differentiation Customer diversity Global presence Trusted vendor Optical core to customer premise End-to-end automation &amp; insights Enhanced security and assurance Balanced mix of national SPs, regional SPs, enterprise and ICP customers Projected growth opportunities in each segment Geo-diverse supply chain Globally diverse R&amp;D, sales and support Strong geographic mix of customers Secure networking specialist Long history with top tier SP, enterprise and government customers Leading alternative to high-risk vendors Broad portfolio and a trusted supplier to customers around the globe</font></p>
