  <p><font style="margin:0 0 0 0;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:1pt;font-family:Times New Roman;">Revenue above target Non-GAAP gross margin Increasing non-GAAP operating margin Higher Non-GAAP EPS Revenue of $291.6m, up +4% q-o-q &amp; +20%&#160;y-o-y and above the high-end of prior outlook*             ($275.0m-$285.0m) Strong demand for fiber networking solutions Higher non-GAAP gross margin Non-GAAP gross margin of 42.5%, increased by 122 bps y-o-y Improved product &amp; customer mix plus scale Non-GAAP operating margin of 6.4%, up from 5.4% q-o-q, and an increase from 2.4% y-o-y Accelerated growth in operating margin Non-GAAP EPS $0.16, up from a loss of $0.02       y-o-y, and $0.05 q-o-q Strong execution and increased scale benefitting bottom-line results Business update Q4 2025 highlights Non-GAAP gross margin is calculated as non-GAAP gross profit divided by revenue. Non-GAAP operating margin is calculated as non-GAAP operating income divided by revenue. A reconciliation of each non-GAAP financial measure to the most comparable GAAP measure is included in the appendix of this presentation. *Outlook provided on November 3, 2025. $291.6M 42.5% 6.4% $0.16</font></p>
